  "forAnalyst": "The same search capability on Elasticsearch 9.",
  "forArchitect": "The forward-looking Elasticsearch adapter, with the same twelve-setting surface as the 8.x one. Two adapters for one engine family exist so an upgrade is an install, not a migration.",
  "forDeveloper": "Run one at a time. Treat a major-version move as a reindex exercise: build the new index alongside, then switch.",
